    H/TITLE SR04337  - CA - Agreement Limiting and Restricting Insur
     *                      Joint Venture
     *===============================================================*
     * WC040337                                                      *
     *                                                               *
     * Program Description:                                          *
     *                                                               *
     *   Determines if this endorsement form should be attached to   *
     *   the policy and creates data in the Endorsement Form         *
     *   Workfile (WXFMP) prior to a form merge.                     *
     *                                                               *
     * Created   : 06/09/04                                          *
     * Programmer: C:61                                              *
     * Project   : CM027                                             *
     *===============================================================*
     * REVISIONS:                                                    *
     * 05/02/17   C:180   PROJECT: WC2483                            *
      *                    - Add Scriptura interface                  *
     *                    - Check for joint venture type of business.*
     *                                                               *
     * ------------------------------------------------------------- *
     *  NOTE: Please add comments to the top of revisions.           *
     * ------------------------------------------------------------- *
     *===============================================================*
     * Notes:                                                        *
     *                                                               *
     *  Utilizes the endorsement copybook (SCOPYEN01F/I/C).          *
     *                                                               *
     *  QQMODE = 1 - Called to determine if form should be attached. *
     *  QQMODE = 2 - Called to print endorsement.                    *
     *  QQMODE = 3 - Called for additional input.                    *
     *  QQMODE = 4 - Called for mid-term processing.                 *
     *===============================================================*
    
     ** Copybook F specs
     F/COPY SCOPYEN01F
    
    
     *=========================================================================
     *  Definition Specs
     *=========================================================================
      * Entry
     D SR04337         PR
     D                                3
     D                                3
     D                                9
     D                                5
     D                                3
     D                                1
     D                                9  0
     D                                1
     D SR04337         PI
     D  qqco#                         3
     D  qqfnd                         3
     D  qqemp#                        9
     D  qqdiv                         5
     D  qqfyr                         3
     D  qqmode                        1
     D  qqrrn                         9  0
     D  qqmod2                        1

     ** Copybook D specs
     D/COPY SCOPYEN01D
